{"id":"n3-040","title":"～ちゃった","romaji":"〜chatta","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Express an unintentional action or a regretful action; 'ended up doing', 'did accidentally'.","longExplanation":"The ～ちゃった grammar point is the informal, colloquial version of ～てしまった. It expresses unintentional or regretful actions and can be translated as 'ended up doing' or 'did accidentally'.","formation":"Verb-て/で form → ちゃった/じゃった (e.g. 食べてしまった → 食べちゃった)","examples":[{"jp":"忘れ物をしちゃった。","romaji":"Wasuremono o shichatta.","en":"I accidentally left something behind.","words":[{"surface":"忘れ物","vocabId":"1519230","reading":"わすれもの"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ちゃっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ちゃう"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]},{"jp":"寝坊して遅刻しちゃった。","romaji":"Nebou shite chikoku shichatta.","en":"I overslept and ended up being late.","words":[{"surface":"寝坊","vocabId":"1360320","reading":"ねぼう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遅刻","vocabId":"1422050","reading":"ちこく"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ちゃっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ちゃう"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]},{"jp":"ケーキを全部食べちゃった。","romaji":"Keeki o zenbu tabechatta.","en":"I ended up eating the whole cake.","words":[{"surface":"ケーキ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"全部","vocabId":"1396130","reading":"ぜんぶ"},{"surface":"食べちゃった","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべちゃった","baseForm":"食べる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"言わないつもりだったけど、言っちゃった。","romaji":"Iwanai tsumori datta kedo, icchatta.","en":"I wasn't planning to say it, but I ended up saying it.","words":[{"surface":"言わない","vocabId":"1587040","reading":"いわない","baseForm":"言う"},{"surface":"つもり","vocabId":null},{"